{"id":"da9db343d0f4d1db","group":"27","path":"27/27-df-decomposableextension.md","title":"One-bit functional decomposition and positive decomposition","display":"df-decomposableextension — One-bit functional decomposition and positive decomposition","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-df-decomposableextension","aliases":["27-df-decomposableextension"],"display":"df-decomposableextension — One-bit functional decomposition and positive decomposition","depends_on":[],"source_file":"C:/Users/lzy/Documents/BaiduSyncdisk/calibre/Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer/Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)/Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf","source_section":"§12.3.6 equation (12.19)","source_printed_pages":"539–540","source_pdf_pages":"563–564","verification_status":"source-definition-checked-overlapping-coordinate-blocks"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-df-decomposableextension"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-df-decomposableextension</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-decomposableextension — One-bit functional decomposition and positive decomposition"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:/Users/lzy/Documents/BaiduSyncdisk/calibre/Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer/Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)/Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§12.3.6 equation (12.19)"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"539–540"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"563–564"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-definition-checked-overlapping-coordinate-blocks"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb Z_{\\ge0}\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb Z_{\\ge0}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb B=\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\mathbb B=\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[n]=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\">\\([n]=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S_0,S_1\\subseteq[n]\">\\(S_0,S_1\\subseteq[n]\\)</span>，允许相交；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi_i,D_0,D_1\">\\(\\pi_i,D_0,D_1\\)</span> 由下式构造，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D_0,D_1\">\\(D_0,D_1\\)</span> 均取逐坐标序；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g:D_0\\to\\mathbb B\">\\(g:D_0\\to\\mathbb B\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h:D_1\\to\\mathbb B\">\\(h:D_1\\to\\mathbb B\\)</span>。下式定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Dec}_{S_0,S_1}\">\\(\\mathrm{Dec}_{S_0,S_1}\\)</span> 及正子类 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PosDec}_{S_0,S_1}\">\\(\\mathrm{PosDec}_{S_0,S_1}\\)</span>。 同时引入递增谓词 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Inc}_D(q)\">\\(\\mathrm{Inc}_D(q)\\)</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\\in\\{D_0,D_1\\}\">\\(D\\in\\{D_0,D_1\\}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q:D\\to\\mathbb B\">\\(q:D\\to\\mathbb B\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"D_0\\coloneqq\\mathbb B^{S_0}\\times\\mathbb B,\\qquad D_1\\coloneqq\\mathbb B^{S_1}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[D_0\\coloneqq\\mathbb B^{S_0}\\times\\mathbb B,\\qquad D_1\\coloneqq\\mathbb B^{S_1}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\pi_i:\\mathbb B^n\\to\\mathbb B^{S_i},\\qquad\\pi_i(x)\\coloneqq x|_{S_i}\\quad(i\\in\\{0,1\\},\\ x\\in\\mathbb B^n).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\pi_i:\\mathbb B^n\\to\\mathbb B^{S_i},\\qquad\\pi_i(x)\\coloneqq x|_{S_i}\\quad(i\\in\\{0,1\\},\\ x\\in\\mathbb B^n).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Inc}_D(q)\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall u,v\\in D\\;(u\\le v\\Rightarrow q(u)\\le q(v)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Inc}_D(q)\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall u,v\\in D\\;(u\\le v\\Rightarrow q(u)\\le q(v)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Dec}_{S_0,S_1}\\coloneqq\n\\{f\\in\\mathbb B^{\\mathbb B^n}\\mid\n\\exists h\\in\\mathbb B^{D_1}\\;\\exists g\\in\\mathbb B^{D_0}\\;\n\\forall x\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;(f(x)=g(\\pi_0(x),h(\\pi_1(x))))\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Dec}_{S_0,S_1}\\coloneqq\n\\{f\\in\\mathbb B^{\\mathbb B^n}\\mid\n\\exists h\\in\\mathbb B^{D_1}\\;\\exists g\\in\\mathbb B^{D_0}\\;\n\\forall x\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;(f(x)=g(\\pi_0(x),h(\\pi_1(x))))\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PosDec}_{S_0,S_1}\\coloneqq\n\\{f\\in\\mathbb B^{\\mathbb B^n}\\mid\n\\exists h\\in\\mathbb B^{D_1}\\;\\exists g\\in\\mathbb B^{D_0}\\;\n(\\mathrm{Inc}_{D_1}(h)\\land\\mathrm{Inc}_{D_0}(g)\\land\n\\forall x\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;(f(x)=g(\\pi_0(x),h(\\pi_1(x)))))\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{PosDec}_{S_0,S_1}\\coloneqq\n\\{f\\in\\mathbb B^{\\mathbb B^n}\\mid\n\\exists h\\in\\mathbb B^{D_1}\\;\\exists g\\in\\mathbb B^{D_0}\\;\n(\\mathrm{Inc}_{D_1}(h)\\land\\mathrm{Inc}_{D_0}(g)\\land\n\\forall x\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;(f(x)=g(\\pi_0(x),h(\\pi_1(x)))))\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 §12.3.6，印刷 pp.539–540／PDF pp.563–564。h把整个S1块压成一个比特，再与直接可见的S0块交给g。这个类不等于任意少变量支持类；块可相交、可漏掉部分坐标，签名仍明确。正子类要求g和h均递增，不能仅要求最终复合函数递增。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb Z_{\\ge0}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb B=\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"[n]=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}","display":false},{"tex":"S_0,S_1\\subseteq[n]","display":false},{"tex":"\\pi_i,D_0,D_1","display":false},{"tex":"D_0,D_1","display":false},{"tex":"g:D_0\\to\\mathbb B","display":false},{"tex":"h:D_1\\to\\mathbb B","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Dec}_{S_0,S_1}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PosDec}_{S_0,S_1}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Inc}_D(q)","display":false},{"tex":"D\\in\\{D_0,D_1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"q:D\\to\\mathbb B","display":false},{"tex":"D_0\\coloneqq\\mathbb B^{S_0}\\times\\mathbb B,\\qquad D_1\\coloneqq\\mathbb B^{S_1}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\pi_i:\\mathbb B^n\\to\\mathbb B^{S_i},\\qquad\\pi_i(x)\\coloneqq x|_{S_i}\\quad(i\\in\\{0,1\\},\\ x\\in\\mathbb B^n).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Inc}_D(q)\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall u,v\\in D\\;(u\\le v\\Rightarrow q(u)\\le q(v)).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Dec}_{S_0,S_1}\\coloneqq\n\\{f\\in\\mathbb B^{\\mathbb B^n}\\mid\n\\exists h\\in\\mathbb B^{D_1}\\;\\exists g\\in\\mathbb B^{D_0}\\;\n\\forall x\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;(f(x)=g(\\pi_0(x),h(\\pi_1(x))))\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PosDec}_{S_0,S_1}\\coloneqq\n\\{f\\in\\mathbb B^{\\mathbb B^n}\\mid\n\\exists h\\in\\mathbb B^{D_1}\\;\\exists g\\in\\mathbb B^{D_0}\\;\n(\\mathrm{Inc}_{D_1}(h)\\land\\mathrm{Inc}_{D_0}(g)\\land\n\\forall x\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;(f(x)=g(\\pi_0(x),h(\\pi_1(x)))))\\}.","display":true}],"bytes":2248,"backlinks":[{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-112","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[27-df-decomposableextension|df-decomposableextension — One-bit functional decomposition and positive decomposition]]"},{"id":"e62c73211a995105","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb Z_{\\ge0}$，$T,F\\subseteq\\mathbb B^n$，$S_0,S_1\\subseteq[n]$；$\\mathrm{Dec}_{S_0,S_1},\\pi_0,\\pi_1$ 见 [[27-df-decomposableextension]]，$\\mathrm{Ext}_n$ 见 [[27-df-extension]]。另令 $V$ 为有限集、$E\\subseteq V\\times V$；$\\mathrm{TwoColor}$ 为该类有序对上的谓词。$V^*,E^*$ 由下式构造，边允许自环。"},{"id":"8e388cfde0a77ba8","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb Z_{\\ge0}$，$T,F\\subseteq\\mathbb B^n$，$S_0,S_1\\subseteq[n]$；$\\pi_i,\\mathrm{PosDec}_{S_0,S_1}$ 见 [[27-df-decomposableextension]]，$\\mathrm{Ext}_n$ 见 [[27-df-extension]]。$T^*,F^*$ 由下式构造；$D_0=\\mathbb B^{S_0}\\times\\mathbb B$、$D_1=\\mathbb B^{S_1}$ 见 [[27-df-decomposableextension]]，$h_*:D_1\\to\\mathbb B$、$g_*:D_0\\to\\mathbb B$ 由下式定义。"}],"outgoing":[]}